StorageGrid Support Engineer SSH Cheat Sheet

SSH Access
Admin user: ssh admin@<admin-node-IP>
Support user: ssh support@<admin-node-IP>

Core Health & Status Commands
Overall grid status: storagegrid-status
Node health: sudo storagegrid node health
List services: sudo storagegrid node services
Appliance info: sudo storagegrid appliance info
Appliance status: sudo storagegrid appliance status

Service Control
Status: sudo service <service-name> status
Restart: sudo service <service-name> restart
Common examples: sudo service nginx-gw restart sudo service storagegrid-nodeid restart

System Information
Version: cat /etc/storagegrid-release
Uptime: uptime
CPU/memory: top free -h
Disk usage: df -h lsblk
Hostname: hostname

Network Troubleshooting
Show IPs: ip addr show
Routing: ip route
Ping: ping <node-ip>
StorageGrid network test: sudo storagegrid node network test <node-name>
Hosts file: cat /etc/hosts
DNS lookup: nslookup <hostname> dig <hostname>

Log Viewing
Live main log: tail -f /var/local/log/bycast.log
Live server manager: tail -f /var/local/log/servermanager.log
View recent entries: tail -n 100 /var/local/log/bycast.log
Search errors: grep -i "error" /var/local/log/bycast.log
Search for specific string: grep -i "s3|timeout|connection" /var/local/log/bycast.log
Show 5 lines around match: grep -iC 5 "connection refused" /var/local/log/bycast.log
Count errors: grep -c "error" /var/local/log/bycast.log

Audit Logs
Tail audit: tail -f /var/local/audit/export/audit.log
Search audit entries: grep "SHEA|SLAU|SADD" /var/local/audit/export/audit.log
View audit file: cat /var/local/audit/export/audit.log

Support Bundle
Generate support bundle: sudo /usr/local/scripts/create-support-bundle.sh

Important Log Locations
Main StorageGrid logs: /var/local/log/
Main log: /var/local/log/bycast.log
Server manager: /var/local/log/servermanager.log
Audit logs: /var/local/audit/export/
NMS logs: /var/local/log/nms.log
SSM logs: /var/local/log/ssm.log
Gateway/load balancer: /var/local/log/nginx-gw.log
Grid Manager API: /var/local/log/management-api.log
Prometheus: /var/local/log/prometheus.log
Archived logs: /var/local/log/.gz /var/local/log/.1

Common Troubleshooting Use Cases
A. S3 Connection Issues

Check service: sudo service nginx-gw status
Search S3 errors: grep -i s3 /var/local/log/bycast.log
SSL/cert check: grep -i "ssl|certificate|handshake" /var/local/log/bycast.log
Tail live: tail -f /var/local/log/bycast.log | grep -i "error|timeout|connection"
B. ILM / Data Placement Problems

Search ILM/placement: grep -i "ilm|placement|replication" /var/local/log/bycast.log
Audit message search: grep "ILMP|ILMF" /var/local/audit/export/audit.log
C. Performance Bottlenecks

Check CPU/memory: top free -h
Check disk usage: df -h
Monitor network: ifstat 1
Check interface errors: ethtool -S <interface-name>
D. Node Connectivity

Show interfaces: ip link show
Check IPs: ip addr show
Test remote connectivity: sudo storagegrid node network test <remote-node-name>

Quick Reference Commands
Overall health: echo "=== Version ===" && cat /etc/storagegrid-release &&
echo "=== Services ===" && sudo storagegrid-status &&
echo "=== Disk Usage ===" && df -h /var/local/storage/objects &&
echo "=== Recent Errors ===" && tail -n 20 /var/local/log/bycast.log | grep -i error

Real-time monitor: tail -f /var/local/log/bycast.log | grep -i --color=auto "error|timeout|warning"

Export logs: tar -czf storagegrid-logs.tar.gz /var/local/log/ /var/local/audit/export/

Common Audit Log Codes
SHEA = S3 HEAD request
SLAU = S3 login attempt/user auth
SADD = S3 ADD / PUT object
SDEL = S3 DELETE object
SGET = S3 GET object
ILMX = ILM execution
SARG = S3 arguments

Best Practices
Always collect logs before deeper troubleshooting
Use timestamps to narrow search windows
Use audit logs for permission, access, and object operations
Use Grid Manager for alarms and health checks
Create a support bundle when escalating to NetApp Support
